staurant", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:24:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "I think the man watches his version of zee cinema", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:24:27Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "TNT/TCM from our childhood 😀", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:25:06Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I remember being so pissed when Cartoon Network would switch to TNT at 9 PM and begin showing old hollywood movies", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:25:12Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Except when they showed WCW", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:26:09Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "For introductory years I was a mile rotunda and steiner fan before the rock 😅\nOnly because wo had the cassette video game called wcw nitro 😂", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:26:10Z", "username": "Sayu Sekhar", "text": "The fact that I am not getting these acronyms,.. not sure I am too old or too young .. probably the former 😛   ( or just plain ignorance as boards ke time no cable)", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:26:25Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "There was a kviz show question on Sympathy for Lady Vengeance too, inspiration for Kill Bill", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:26:49Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "That time even I didn't know acronyms 😂. Learnt much later 😅", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:26:52Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "That was fairly recent so I remember😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:27:04Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "I remember this one", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:27:20Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "I think I was in the panel 😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-10T20:27:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Or the audience", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]